{{Quote|I have need for you on the master's sail barge, and I think you'll fill in nicely.|[[EV-9D9]] to [[R2-D2]]|<ref name="ROTJ" />}}
'''Sail barges''' were a class of large atmospheric transport. The [[Hutt]] [[crime lord]] [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]] owned<ref name="ROTJ">{{Film|VI}}</ref> a modified [[LO-KD57]] sail barge,<ref name="Rebel Files">''[[Star Wars: The Rebel Files]]''</ref> the ''[[Khetanna]]'', manufactured by [[Ubrikkian Industries]],<ref name="Ultimate" /> which he used to travel to the [[Great Pit of Carkoon]].<ref name="ROTJ" />

The [[Warbird gang]] of [[pirate]]s used a sail barge called the ''[[Galleon]]'', built from the wrecks of various old vehicles from the [[Galactic Empire]], as their headquarters.<ref name="The Doza Dilemma" />

